Subject: [PATCH] ROUTES-1: /move funds an envelope from Ready to Assign again

The screen's From list opens on Ready to Assign, and posting it answered
404 "That envelope does not exist.": the handler checked the source
against the viewer's envelopes before it looked for "rta", which is not
one. Found by a route sweep submitting every rendered form as drawn.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
